        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"多边形认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一个多边形有八个顶点，它有多少条边？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"6 条"},{"id":"b","text":"7 条"},{"id":"c","text":"8 条"},{"id":"d","text":"10 条"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"多边形顶点与边一一对应，八个顶点构成八条边。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"圆的认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一个圆的直径是 18 cm，它的半径是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"6 cm"},{"id":"b","text":"9 cm"},{"id":"c","text":"18 cm"},{"id":"d","text":"36 cm"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"半径是直径的一半，所以半径为 18÷2＝9 cm。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"对角线计数","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"三角形也有对角线。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"三角形的任意两个顶点都相邻，连接它们只能得到边，不能得到对角线。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"多边形认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"关于正多边形，下列哪些说法正确？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"各条边的长度相等"},{"id":"b","text":"各个内角的大小相等"},{"id":"c","text":"只要各边相等就一定是正多边形"},{"id":"d","text":"正方形是正多边形"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"正多边形要同时满足等边、等角，例如非正方形的菱形虽等边，但角不全等，因此仅等边不够。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"对角线计数","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"从凸八边形的一个顶点出发，可画多少条对角线？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"4 条"},{"id":"b","text":"5 条"},{"id":"c","text":"6 条"},{"id":"d","text":"8 条"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"去掉该顶点自身和两个相邻顶点，可以连接的顶点有 8－3＝5 个。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"圆的认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"两个圆的半径分别为 3 cm 和 5 cm，这两个圆的半径长度相等。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"同一个圆的所有半径相等，但不同圆的半径可能不同；这里 3 cm 不等于 5 cm。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"扇形关系","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"把一个圆等分为 12 个扇形，每个扇形的圆心角是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"15°"},{"id":"b","text":"30°"},{"id":"c","text":"45°"},{"id":"d","text":"60°"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"整个圆对应 360°，平均分成 12 份，得到 360°÷12＝30°。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"扇形关系","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"关于圆心角为 90°的扇形，下列哪些结论正确？（多选）","options":[{"id":"a","text":"它的面积是所在圆面积的 1/4"},{"id":"b","text":"它的两条直边都是所在圆的半径"},{"id":"c","text":"它的面积是所在圆面积的 1/2"},{"id":"d","text":"它的圆心角是直角"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"90°÷360°＝1/4；扇形由两条半径和一条弧围成，90°也是直角。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"对角线计数","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一个凸六边形从某个顶点画出所有对角线后，被分成多少个三角形？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3 个"},{"id":"b","text":"4 个"},{"id":"c","text":"5 个"},{"id":"d","text":"6 个"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"从同一顶点画出的对角线把凸 n 边形分成 n－2 个三角形，因此为 6－2＝4 个。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c4-polygons-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c4-polygons","capabilityTag":"扇形关系","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"某扇形的面积是所在圆面积的 2/5，它的圆心角是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"72°"},{"id":"b","text":"120°"},{"id":"c","text":"144°"},{"id":"d","text":"216°"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"圆心角与一周的比例也是 2/5，所以圆心角为 360°×2/5＝144°。","source":"local-reviewed"}
